sequenceDiagram

actor Admin
participant Server as server.js
participant Route as routes/admin.js + guards + validation
participant C as controllers/providerLifecycle.js
participant M as Provider / ProviderApplication
participant DB as MongoDB
Admin->>Server: POST /api/v1/admin/providers/{providerId}/reactivate
Server->>Route: Parsed JSON
Route->>C: Admin actor, providerId and resolutionNote
activate C
C->>DB: Start transaction
C->>M: Increment Provider revision guard
M->>DB: Guard provider
C->>M: Load current approved application
M->>DB: Read profile in session
C->>C: Require suspended provider and approved profile
C->>M: Save approved status and resolution audit fields
M->>DB: Persist provider in same session
DB-->>C: Commit
C->>C: Serialize provider
C-->>Server: 200 success
deactivate C
Server-->>Admin: JSON response
Note over C,DB: Wrong lifecycle state is 409, missing provider is 404, failures abort
Note over M,DB: Booking history, vehicle flags and session records remain unchanged
